  "content": "<p>Небольшой мод, добавляющий жирных свиней!</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Мобы:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_30e93136-8535-40a1-b682-abbf9150cb72.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"406\" height=\"253\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>Предметы:</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_6ac8272c-616f-47d2-a924-e843a7dc85d2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"218\" height=\"218\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_df238859-d4d3-446c-b9a5-c05e5936043b.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"244\" height=\"244\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Сырое мясо жирной свиньи&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Жареное мясо жирной свиньи</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_b1159d7b-a5ce-4c82-80d5-a5757f6a315f.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"202\" height=\"202\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7e66eab8-05c5-42a1-85e8-50f1c7ee0702.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"248\" height=\"248\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Белая морковь&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Жирное рагу</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>",
